# Muse-Glimmer-30B, served by llama.cpp — locally with `outfit serve`, or on
# a cloud GPU with `outfit remote deploy` (see the README in this directory).
# ALIAS names the model in opencode and selects the preset section below.
PROVIDER llamacpp
ALIAS    muse-glimmer-30b
CONTEXT  32768              # match the server's --ctx-size; trimmed down from
                             # the model's 131072 native max to keep the KV
                             # cache modest — raise it if you need the room
PRESET   ./preset.ini       # `outfit serve` and `outfit remote deploy` both read this
REMOTE   muse-glimmer-30b   # environment name; `outfit remote deploy` creates and registers it
# BASEURL http://127.0.0.1:9090/v1   # uncomment for a non-default local host/port
